* CAN2 (CAN, page 4): MES4-CIF rule 8 check, "no series resistors on CANH / CANL". A carrier puts Rs in each line between
* the fingers and the bus; this module (JP1 open) drives a bus terminated at both ends (60 ohm). Rs stepped 0 / 22 / 47 / 100 ohm,
* driver typical (Rd 13.5) and weakest (Rd 38). The far receivers need VOD >= 0.9 V (VIT+ max); ISO 11898-2 asks 1.5 V.
.step param Rs list 1m 22 47 100
.step param Rd list 13.5 38
.include models.inc
V3   v3 0 3.3
Vrec rec 0 3.3
Vtx  txd 0 0
XU3A txd ha la v3 0 HVD230 Rd={Rd}
XD1A ha la 0 NUP2105L
RsH  ha bh {Rs}
RsL  la bl {Rs}
Rterm bh bl 60
XU3B rec bh bl v3 0 HVD230 Rd={Rd}
.tran 0 2u 0 1n
.save V(bh) V(bl)
.meas tran vod FIND V(bh,bl) AT 1.9u
.end
